    title: "What to Expect When Visiting a Lighting Showroom in Dubai",
    excerpt: "How to make the most of your lighting showroom visit — what to prepare, what to look for, and how to compare fixtures effectively.",
    category: "Buying Guide",
    author: "Design Team",
