    slug: "luxury-lighting-solutions-dubai",
    title: "Luxury Lighting Solutions for Dubai Interiors",
    excerpt: "How premium lighting design transforms luxury residential and hospitality spaces in Dubai — techniques, fixture selection, and design principles.",
    category: "Residential Lighting",
    author: "Interior Lighting Specialist",
